# HELP cubesigner_signer_policy_evaluations_total Signed requests whose explain policy_eval_tree proved a live policy evaluation, by leaf outcome. Distinct outcome per sign: a policy attached at both role and key level is one observation. Liveness: sum should track successful signs; a gap means the tree stopped arriving. Denied is seeded but effectively unobservable today: the SDK discards the 412 body that carries a deny-path tree (denials are counted in cubesigner_signer_policy_denials_total instead).
# TYPE cubesigner_signer_policy_evaluations_total counter
cubesigner_signer_policy_evaluations_total{outcome="Permitted"} 0
cubesigner_signer_policy_evaluations_total{outcome="Denied"} 0

# HELP cubesigner_signer_policy_fallback_txid_mismatch_total Fallback events whose policy-reported unsigned_txid does not match the gateway-derived unsigned-transaction txid of the PSBT we signed. Should stay at exactly 0 forever; any nonzero value means the policy and the gateway are not signing the same transaction view and everything downstream of that comparison is suspect.
# TYPE cubesigner_signer_policy_fallback_txid_mismatch_total counter
cubesigner_signer_policy_fallback_txid_mismatch_total 0

# HELP cubesigner_signer_policy_rule_info The rule identity (policy_id and rule hash) that the live policy evaluation reported, as observed on the most recent signed request. Deliberate exception to the no-identifier rule, same class as build_info: the value IS the pinned-version attestation. Absent until the first signed request; children accumulate per distinct observed pair since process start. Alert when hash/policy_id differ from the reviewed pin.
# TYPE cubesigner_signer_policy_rule_info gauge

# HELP cubesigner_signer_policy_eval_tree_unparseable_total Signs whose explain policy_eval_tree was present but could not be parsed for the fallback event: the tree root was not a traversable structure, or a parsed fallback event carried a failure_code outside the closed 13-value domain. Any nonzero value means the Cubist tree shape or the policy event contract changed and fallback observability is degraded; investigate immediately.
# TYPE cubesigner_signer_policy_eval_tree_unparseable_total counter
cubesigner_signer_policy_eval_tree_unparseable_total 0
